<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If one day storms beset our way,</l><l>Will we then be shaken, fall away?</l><l>Our only Hope now lives in us;</l><l>Trusting in His flow we stay.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>While we’re yearning, waiting for Him,</l><l>Let’s seize today by enjoying Him,</l><l>Letting Christ make home within us—</l><l>Our portion, life and glory.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
